%%{init: {"sequence": {"mirrorActors": false, "messageMargin": 16, "actorMargin": 10, "boxMargin": 6, "noteMargin": 6, "width": 70}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Bibliophile
    participant AM as Account<br/>Model
    participant A as Accounts
    participant S as SyncLibrary<br/>UseCase
    participant L as SyncStore<br/>(phone)
    participant B as Library<br/>Backup
    participant LM as LibraryApp<br/>Model
    U->>AM: "Sign in"
    AM->>A: signIn(email,<br/>password)
    A-->>AM: Account
    AM->>S: signedIn(id)
    S->>L: versions(id)
    S->>B: pull(id)
    Note over S: newer<br/>updatedAt<br/>wins
    S->>L: apply newer<br/>remote
    S->>B: push newer<br/>local
    S->>S: adopt the<br/>phone's books
    AM->>B: watch(id)
    AM->>LM: owner changed
    LM-->>U: account's books
    Note over B: another phone<br/>changes a book
    B-->>AM: Realtime notice
    AM->>S: execute(id)
    S-->>AM: downloaded n
    AM->>LM: reload shelves
